00:35.118 --> 00:36.995
[gangsters cheering]

00:38.705 --> 00:40.999
[both grunting]

00:45.045 --> 00:46.880
[chains rattling]

00:48.715 --> 00:49.841
[grunts]

00:56.931 --> 00:58.683
[gangsters exclaim]

01:02.145 --> 01:03.646
- [grunts]
- [groans]

01:05.315 --> 01:06.524
[yells]

01:06.608 --> 01:09.903
[gangsters cheering]

01:09.986 --> 01:11.821
[breathing heavily]

01:13.573 --> 01:14.574
[grunts]

01:17.368 --> 01:18.328
[Gangjae groans]

01:18.411 --> 01:19.954
[grunting]

01:27.212 --> 01:29.756
[gangsters cheering]

01:32.342 --> 01:34.469
- [body thuds]
- [gangsters] Oh!

01:39.265 --> 01:40.433
[loud thud]

01:41.184 --> 01:44.145
[Jiwoo panting]

01:46.314 --> 01:49.109
[panting continues]

01:57.283 --> 01:59.327
[gangsters cheering]

02:03.790 --> 02:09.295
[crowd] Dongcheon! Dongcheon! Dongcheon!
Dongcheon! Dongcheon! Dongcheon!

02:09.379 --> 02:13.007
Dongcheon! Dongcheon! Dongcheon!
Dongcheon! Dongcheon!

02:13.967 --> 02:15.510
[gasping]

02:15.593 --> 02:16.970
[Cheol-Ho] You're awake, dumbass?

02:17.053 --> 02:19.013
Hey, are you finally awake?

02:19.097 --> 02:20.890
Get out here and die.

02:20.974 --> 02:23.059
[laughing]

02:24.769 --> 02:27.939
You got your ass beat by a girl
and you blacked out.

02:28.022 --> 02:29.899
- I wanna kill myself out of humiliation.
- [bangs on floor]

02:29.983 --> 02:30.817
[chuckles]

02:30.900 --> 02:31.776
[clears throat]

02:31.860 --> 02:33.194
[grumbles]

02:33.862 --> 02:36.364
[panting]

02:39.701 --> 02:42.495
[gangsters cheering]

02:53.131 --> 02:54.841
[water trickling]

03:04.184 --> 03:05.393
[Jiwoo] About earlier…

03:09.856 --> 03:11.357
I wanna apologize.

03:13.193 --> 03:15.653
[scoffs]
Apologize for what?

03:16.821 --> 03:18.072
It's just a fight.

03:26.122 --> 03:28.249
Hey, man, you wanna hang out now?

03:28.333 --> 03:29.167
[groans]

03:29.250 --> 03:31.377
Why? So you can get drunk?

03:31.461 --> 03:32.921
Black out and die.

03:33.004 --> 03:34.088
Uh, no.

03:34.964 --> 03:36.716
I thought we could go…

03:55.526 --> 03:56.903
[chuckles]

03:56.986 --> 03:58.071
What?

03:59.197 --> 04:01.866
Don't be such a pussy.
You're always saying you want her.

04:02.617 --> 04:04.202
Asshole, do you lost its fucking mind?

04:04.285 --> 04:05.286
[chuckles]

04:05.995 --> 04:07.247
[gangster minor] Hey.

04:07.330 --> 04:09.123
Don't do anything stupid, man.

04:09.207 --> 04:10.708
You know the boss brought her.

04:10.792 --> 04:12.877
And she won't remember anything though.

04:14.629 --> 04:16.464
You know, I roofied her water earlier.

04:24.055 --> 04:25.014
[sighs]

04:31.104 --> 04:32.313
[coughs]

04:34.023 --> 04:35.066
[Jiwoo sighs]

04:37.318 --> 04:38.236
[exhales deeply]

04:48.162 --> 04:49.205
[sighs]

04:52.083 --> 04:52.917
[exhales deeply]

05:05.513 --> 05:06.347
[sighs]

05:06.431 --> 05:08.891
[Cheol-Ho chuckles]
Such a stingy little shit, bro.

05:09.892 --> 05:12.854
Well, if you really wanna go that far,
I guess I can't refuse.

05:12.937 --> 05:14.689
[laughing]

05:15.773 --> 05:16.607
Yo.

05:17.775 --> 05:19.861
You don't have to come
if you're so scared.

05:25.491 --> 05:27.785
[ominous music]

05:35.126 --> 05:38.296
[laughing]

05:40.673 --> 05:42.175
I owe you, Gangjae.

05:42.258 --> 05:44.302
[laughing]

05:44.385 --> 05:48.431
[Cheol-Ho] You know, you're the prettiest
little thing around, fucking slut.

05:48.514 --> 05:50.308
- Ah, you make me so hard.
- [Gangjae chuckles]

05:50.391 --> 05:51.642
[Cheol-Ho] I wanna taste you.

05:51.726 --> 05:54.145
- [Gangjae laughing]
- [zipper zips open]

05:54.228 --> 05:55.688
Aah.

05:56.814 --> 05:58.566
Ah, promise I won't be too rough.

05:58.649 --> 05:59.901
- [Jiwoo groaning]
- [Gangjae] Hold still.

05:59.984 --> 06:02.528
- [Cheol-Ho grunts]
- [groans, pants]

06:04.238 --> 06:05.865
You need to calm down.

06:06.449 --> 06:08.284
The whole thing will be over soon.

06:08.368 --> 06:09.202
[exhales deeply]

06:10.953 --> 06:12.997
[Cheol-Ho] Stay.
[moans]

06:13.081 --> 06:14.916
Oh! Dirty slut, I can't take it.

06:14.999 --> 06:16.834
- [Jiwoo grunts]
- [Cheol-Ho screams]

06:16.918 --> 06:18.086
DECEASED, YOON DONGHOON

06:18.169 --> 06:20.254
- [Cheol-Ho] Oh, Jesus!
- [Jiwoo groans]

06:20.338 --> 06:21.464
- [Jiwoo pants]
- [Cheol-Ho] Oh!

06:21.547 --> 06:23.299
[laughing]

06:27.011 --> 06:28.638
[Jiwoo] I'm gonna kill you guys.

06:28.721 --> 06:29.597
[Cheol-Ho] Fuck!

06:30.390 --> 06:32.558
I swear I'm gonna kill you guys.
[breathes heavily]

06:32.642 --> 06:34.727
- [Cheol-Ho] It's the fucking bitch…
- [Gangjae laughs]

06:35.686 --> 06:37.313
- [Jiwoo grunts]
- [Cheol-Ho] Shit!

06:37.397 --> 06:38.898
You fucking psycho bitch!

06:38.981 --> 06:40.525
[Cheol-Ho screams]

06:40.608 --> 06:41.984
[groans loudly]

06:44.153 --> 06:46.447
- [Cheol-Ho] No!
- [laughing]

06:47.073 --> 06:49.158
- [screaming continues]
- [Gangjae continues laughing]

06:50.785 --> 06:51.619
You need to die.

06:51.702 --> 06:53.079
[Cheol-Ho screaming]

06:53.162 --> 06:54.163
[Gangjae] Get over here, bitch.

06:54.247 --> 06:57.333
[Cheol-Ho] Gangjae! I'm all fucked up now!

06:57.417 --> 06:58.251
[Gangjae] Yeah?

06:58.334 --> 07:00.086
[Cheol-Ho] That piece of shit!

07:00.169 --> 07:01.671
- [Cheol-Ho screams]
- [Gangjae chuckles]

07:01.754 --> 07:03.714
Come here.
[laughs]

07:03.798 --> 07:05.800
Where are you going, you dumb slut?

07:05.883 --> 07:06.968
[laughs]

07:08.553 --> 07:09.762
[both grunt]

07:11.431 --> 07:13.683
- [Taeju] Gangjae! Stop it! Hey! Gangjae!
- Fucking bitch.

07:13.766 --> 07:14.642
[grunts]

07:15.560 --> 07:17.770
[panting]

07:20.690 --> 07:23.401
[thunder crashing]

07:30.908 --> 07:33.494
[Mujin] Your face, arms, or legs.

07:35.121 --> 07:36.122
Which one?

07:37.540 --> 07:39.041
I'm only going to mutilate one.

07:41.210 --> 07:43.504
[breathes heavily]

07:52.805 --> 07:54.265
I'm really sorry, sir.

07:55.808 --> 07:56.809
Sir, I made a mistake.

07:57.518 --> 07:58.769
And that's why…

08:01.272 --> 08:02.690
I chose not to kill you.

08:02.773 --> 08:03.983
Which one?

08:04.066 --> 08:05.067
[Gangjae breathes heavily]

08:06.777 --> 08:08.321
Are you gonna get rid of me?

08:09.363 --> 08:10.364
[scoffs]

08:11.491 --> 08:13.743
You said I was useful to have around.

08:13.826 --> 08:15.495
It's most unfortunate.

08:18.206 --> 08:19.040
[sword clanks]

08:21.083 --> 08:23.628
I assumed this would eventually
happen to her.

08:23.711 --> 08:25.880
That it was something
she had to go through.

08:27.507 --> 08:28.799
Though I didn't know…

08:33.804 --> 08:35.348
it would be you who did it.

08:35.431 --> 08:37.767
[Gangjae sobs]
Please forgive me, sir.

08:39.143 --> 08:41.437
All I did was push her around a little!

08:41.521 --> 08:43.940
[groaning]

08:44.023 --> 08:46.651
- [Gangjae chokes]
- I, myself, brought her here.

08:48.986 --> 08:50.738
You shouldn't have even touched her.

08:51.239 --> 08:52.156
[chokes]

08:54.075 --> 08:55.743
[Gangjae coughs]

09:01.082 --> 09:02.208
Okay, which one?

09:02.291 --> 09:04.710
- [panting]
- [thunder crashes]

09:05.753 --> 09:07.004
No, I'll decide.

09:08.172 --> 09:10.174
Sir, I'm sorry. No. Please. No.

09:10.258 --> 09:13.010
Please, I'm begging you.
[sobs]

09:13.678 --> 09:14.554
[squeaks]

09:16.430 --> 09:18.391
[blood squirting]

09:18.474 --> 09:20.893
[screaming]

09:21.644 --> 09:23.229
[thunder crashes]

09:24.355 --> 09:26.941
[sobbing]

09:29.068 --> 09:31.654
[sobbing continues]

09:36.909 --> 09:39.328
[sucks teeth]

09:41.622 --> 09:44.458
[breathing heavily]

09:46.669 --> 09:49.422
[rain pattering]

09:49.505 --> 09:54.510
DECEASED, YOON DONGHOON

10:04.520 --> 10:05.563
[sniffles]

10:09.650 --> 10:10.735
[grunts]

10:20.244 --> 10:23.080
[sobbing]

10:45.394 --> 10:47.980
[sobbing continues]

11:01.327 --> 11:03.954
[sobbing continues]

11:11.295 --> 11:13.297
[sobbing continues]

11:35.319 --> 11:36.987
[Taeju] If you're done crying,
please leave.

11:39.407 --> 11:40.491
Because of you,

11:41.283 --> 11:43.577
I've lost one of my best subordinates.

11:46.288 --> 11:47.623
This will be your last chance.

11:49.625 --> 11:51.961
Your very last chance to wise up.

11:54.797 --> 11:56.424
Well, I'm not going anywhere.

12:00.636 --> 12:02.012
When I served Donghoon,

12:02.596 --> 12:03.806
I got to know him very well.

12:05.391 --> 12:07.476
He didn't belong in this line of work.

12:08.644 --> 12:10.146
I can say the same about you.

12:12.356 --> 12:13.607
You should get out now.

12:18.237 --> 12:20.281
It's too late for me to get out.

12:22.074 --> 12:24.076
[rain pattering]

12:50.019 --> 12:51.061
[Mujin] Sit down.

13:02.865 --> 13:05.075
I used to come here
with Donghoon all the time.

13:08.662 --> 13:10.289
Did your dad teach you to drink?

13:22.343 --> 13:23.260
Drink up.

13:31.393 --> 13:32.311
[chokes]

13:32.978 --> 13:34.313
[coughs]

13:38.567 --> 13:39.735
[Mujin] It hurts?

13:43.364 --> 13:44.406
Uh, no.

13:47.117 --> 13:49.411
You never learned how to say
that you're in pain.

13:51.163 --> 13:52.873
Or maybe no one taught you.

13:57.002 --> 13:58.546
Yeah, there was someone…

14:01.423 --> 14:02.633
but he's dead now.

14:07.179 --> 14:08.681
The whole purpose of living…

14:10.057 --> 14:12.601
could be a search
for when to find a person like that.

14:14.395 --> 14:16.647
A person who can tell that you're in pain

14:17.523 --> 14:18.983
and that life is too hard.

14:22.069 --> 14:23.612
Have you found someone like that?

14:25.614 --> 14:27.074
Yes, I did, but he died.

14:28.242 --> 14:30.160
[alcohol pouring]

14:30.953 --> 14:33.205
OCTOPUS STIR-FRY
PORK STIR-FRY

14:33.289 --> 14:35.541
[soft guitar music]

14:54.018 --> 14:56.312
[Mujin] As of today, Yoon Jiwoo is dead.

14:59.565 --> 15:01.483
Do Gangjae has been expelled.

15:02.318 --> 15:03.360
It's punishment for

15:03.944 --> 15:05.571
having murdered that girl.

15:07.615 --> 15:09.033
[Mujin] Oh Hyejin.

15:11.327 --> 15:12.578
From this point on,

15:14.455 --> 15:16.081
you're going to go by this name.

15:25.883 --> 15:26.926
[gun thuds]

15:29.094 --> 15:31.013
Here's the gun that killed your dad.

15:32.097 --> 15:34.391
[Mujin] The killer left it,
and we recovered it.

15:37.144 --> 15:38.646
[Jiwoo] So who was it?

15:39.438 --> 15:41.190
[Mujin] This gun is a police issue.

15:43.275 --> 15:45.069
Donghoon's killer is a policeman.

15:47.363 --> 15:48.864
You're gonna find him.

15:50.324 --> 15:51.492
Kill him.

15:56.330 --> 15:58.540
[action music]

16:00.334 --> 16:03.128
♪ Oh-oh-oh ♪

16:04.213 --> 16:07.341
♪ Oh-oh-oh ♪

16:12.471 --> 16:14.723
[action music continues]

16:22.690 --> 16:28.028
♪ Oh-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa ♪

16:30.739 --> 16:36.620
♪ Oh-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa ♪

16:38.205 --> 16:42.543
♪ Oh-whoa-whoa my past look so blurry ♪

16:44.753 --> 16:48.757
♪ Nobody ♪

16:48.841 --> 16:52.928
♪ No one they say ♪

16:55.389 --> 16:58.017
[Mujin] From now on,
your life belongs to the organization.

17:00.102 --> 17:03.981
No matter what happens,
the organization will protect you.

17:05.607 --> 17:07.985
But betray us, and we will kill you.

17:18.203 --> 17:21.498
[suspenseful music]

17:46.940 --> 17:48.358
[Jiwoo's partner] What do we do now?

17:50.319 --> 17:51.528
We're going upstairs.

17:52.738 --> 17:53.697
[Jiwoo's partner] What?

17:54.531 --> 17:56.075
We don't know how many are in there.

18:23.435 --> 18:25.938
Hey. Call backup and go to the front.

18:27.815 --> 18:28.899
[sighs]

18:38.742 --> 18:39.785
[exhales]

18:41.411 --> 18:43.122
- [engine revs]
- Where are you--

18:43.205 --> 18:44.289
[Jiwoo's partner grunts]

18:45.749 --> 18:46.917
- [engine revs]
- [tires screech]

18:52.506 --> 18:53.882
[doorbell buzzes]

18:57.177 --> 18:58.303
[knocking]

19:00.139 --> 19:01.723
[groaning]

19:09.231 --> 19:10.232
Who are you?

19:10.732 --> 19:11.692
What?

19:13.235 --> 19:14.361
What's going on?

19:14.444 --> 19:16.572
Which department are you with,
you dumbass?

19:27.332 --> 19:29.334
[upbeat music playing]

19:29.418 --> 19:30.669
[woman 1 laughing]

19:40.804 --> 19:44.558
[woman 2 moaning]

19:46.518 --> 19:47.811
Whoo!

19:48.770 --> 19:51.273
[woman 3 chuckling]

20:00.574 --> 20:03.368
[woman 4 wheezing]

20:11.919 --> 20:14.546
[wheezing continues]

20:19.593 --> 20:22.346
[retching]

20:24.389 --> 20:26.225
[coughing]

20:26.308 --> 20:28.310
[wheezing]

20:29.269 --> 20:31.313
[breathing heavily]

20:35.400 --> 20:37.236
[distant thudding]

20:40.614 --> 20:41.615
[Changoo] Money first.

20:41.698 --> 20:42.741
[grunts]

20:44.493 --> 20:45.494
[Pildo] Hey.

20:46.495 --> 20:48.413
I'm not giving you that.
You know what it's worth?

20:48.497 --> 20:49.915
Now, go and call your boss in here.

20:51.083 --> 20:52.793
[scoffs, laughs]

20:52.876 --> 20:55.254
I gonna see the guy's face
if we're gonna be working together.

20:55.337 --> 20:57.172
It's gonna be an equally shared risk.

20:59.049 --> 21:00.133
Now…

21:01.468 --> 21:04.638
- the supply has been running a little low.
- [plastic crinkling]

21:04.721 --> 21:06.640
Apparently, not for you guys, huh?

21:06.723 --> 21:07.933
Yeah. Forget it. Never mind.

21:08.016 --> 21:09.518
Okay. Fine.

21:10.894 --> 21:11.728
Sit down.

21:12.562 --> 21:13.605
Okay.

21:14.648 --> 21:16.483
Radio her. Tell her it's a sting.

21:18.777 --> 21:19.736
Fuckin'…

21:20.862 --> 21:21.863
right now.

21:23.031 --> 21:25.909
[Changoo] This jackass came here alone
and now he wants to talk in person.

21:25.993 --> 21:27.536
- [radio beeps]
- [Jiwoo's partner] Hyejin.

21:27.619 --> 21:29.121
- [Changoo] I think I can take him down…
- [Jiwoo's partner] I'm letting you know.

21:29.204 --> 21:32.082
This is a sting operation. Hyejin. Hyejin!

21:32.165 --> 21:34.251
- [indistinct chatter]
- [glass shattering]

21:34.334 --> 21:37.254
- Freeze where you are, this is the police!
- [Changoo] Are you fucking narc?

21:37.337 --> 21:38.880
- [Pildo] What the hell is she saying?
- Hey, Changoo, get up.

21:38.964 --> 21:40.424
- Oh, shit!
- [thuds]

21:40.507 --> 21:43.302
- [man 1] Grab the knife over there!
- [man 2] Hurry, come on!

21:43.385 --> 21:44.678
[ominous music]

21:44.761 --> 21:46.096
- [woman 5 shrieks]
- Oh, shit.

21:46.179 --> 21:47.389
- Stop right there!
- [loud thud]

21:47.472 --> 21:49.391
- [indistinct shouting]
- [woman 6] What the hell?

21:50.726 --> 21:52.436
[grunting]

21:53.312 --> 21:54.354
[groans]

21:58.025 --> 21:58.859
[grunts]

22:01.528 --> 22:03.280
[groaning]

22:03.363 --> 22:04.448
[clatters]

22:05.115 --> 22:06.158
[grunts]

22:09.870 --> 22:10.954
[pained scream]

22:15.459 --> 22:17.210
- [tires screech]
- [detective] Let's go! Don't let them…

22:17.294 --> 22:18.879
- Block them right there!
- [sirens wailing]

22:22.049 --> 22:25.594
Park Changoo. You're under arrest
for the murder of Lee Sumin.

22:25.677 --> 22:26.762
[Changoo coughs]

22:26.845 --> 22:28.972
[Changoo] Goddamn it!
I can walk on my own.

22:29.056 --> 22:30.557
- Hey.
- [Changoo] Shit.

22:30.640 --> 22:31.975
- Stop right there.
- [Changoo] Fuck.

22:32.059 --> 22:33.602
- Hey!
- [Changoo] Fuck! Argh!

22:33.685 --> 22:35.062
- [Jiwoo] Damnit. Damnit.
- [Changoo] I said I can walk on my own.

22:35.145 --> 22:36.146
- [Pildo] Hey!
- Shit!

22:36.229 --> 22:37.272
[pained groan]

22:37.356 --> 22:38.899
[panting]

22:40.025 --> 22:41.485
So, who the hell are you?

22:41.568 --> 22:42.903
No, who the hell are you?

22:42.986 --> 22:43.945
What?

22:44.654 --> 22:46.198
[scoffs, spits]

22:47.741 --> 22:49.493
I'm Sergeant Jeon Pildo from Narcotics.

22:49.576 --> 22:52.412
[Changoo] Oh, shit, you really are a narc!
[groaning]

22:52.996 --> 22:54.956
Corporal Oh from Violent Crimes Unit Two.

22:56.124 --> 22:57.167
Hey, are you okay?

22:57.250 --> 22:58.543
- Can you try and get up?
- [groans]

22:58.627 --> 22:59.878
My leg. Aah!

22:59.961 --> 23:01.380
- I think my leg is broken.
- Hey, try and relax.

23:01.463 --> 23:02.714
[groans]

23:02.798 --> 23:03.840
[breathes deeply]

23:03.924 --> 23:05.008
- Get an ambulance.
- Yeah.

23:05.092 --> 23:06.426
Let's clean all this up.

23:07.177 --> 23:08.512
Hey. Where's Pildo?

23:08.595 --> 23:09.846
He's upstairs.

23:09.930 --> 23:11.098
[sighs]

23:12.349 --> 23:14.184
Do you have any idea what you've done?

23:14.267 --> 23:15.394
Yeah. I think I do.

23:16.353 --> 23:18.897
- I have an idea.
- [Pildo] Well, that's not enough.

23:18.980 --> 23:22.484
You just ruined a sting operation
we've been setting up for six months.

23:24.152 --> 23:25.404
We'll take care of this asshole.

23:25.487 --> 23:26.863
Stop!

23:26.947 --> 23:28.990
- You can't do that.
- [Pildo] I can't…

23:29.074 --> 23:30.659
I can't do that?

23:31.451 --> 23:33.578
You don't know how to talk
to your superiors, huh?

23:34.663 --> 23:35.872
Are you trying to fuck with me?

23:35.956 --> 23:37.874
- He's suspected of murder.
- [Jiwoo's partner] Hyejin!

23:40.293 --> 23:41.586
It's Captain Lee for you.

23:43.213 --> 23:44.423
- Let's go.
- [Changoo] Aw!

23:44.506 --> 23:46.133
[Jiwoo] Hey! God!

23:48.135 --> 23:49.302
- [frustrated groan]
- Yeah.

23:50.971 --> 23:52.222
What?

23:54.224 --> 23:55.517
Understood, sir.

23:56.643 --> 23:57.686
[sighs]

23:59.521 --> 24:01.064
Send him over to us once you're through.

24:02.816 --> 24:03.859
Hey, wait, stop.

24:03.942 --> 24:05.360
- Oh, god.
- Hey!

24:06.820 --> 24:09.030
I don't wanna see you again, huh?

24:09.114 --> 24:11.283
- Let's go.
- [pained groan]

24:11.366 --> 24:12.701
Damn it.

24:12.784 --> 24:14.995
[Changoo] I'll fuckin' walk on my own!
[groans]

24:16.913 --> 24:18.582
- [Changoo] Argh! Ah!
- [Pildo] Hurry it up.

24:19.082 --> 24:20.375
[Jiwoo] Damn it.

24:30.218 --> 24:32.888
[people clamoring]

24:38.518 --> 24:40.187
You son of a bitch!

24:40.270 --> 24:41.480
[grunting]

24:52.240 --> 24:53.492
[grunts]

24:53.575 --> 24:55.118
[breathes heavily]

24:55.702 --> 24:57.078
Mister… Mr. Choi.

24:57.162 --> 24:59.456
[stutters]
I, uh… I, I was wrong, okay?

25:00.165 --> 25:02.792
This will… This will never ever
happen again, huh?

25:03.376 --> 25:05.962
[Jungoo] We've worked together…
together for ten years, huh?

25:06.046 --> 25:07.255
Please, sir. I beg you.

25:10.467 --> 25:12.260
[men groaning]

25:13.261 --> 25:14.346
Exactly.

25:17.015 --> 25:19.434
So why did you do it
if we worked together for so long?

25:21.770 --> 25:23.605
Don't you know what kind of guy I am?

25:23.688 --> 25:26.316
I, I give you the whole factory
and all the drugs I have.

25:26.399 --> 25:27.526
I…
[breathes heavily]

25:27.609 --> 25:29.444
[stutters]
I must have… have lost…

25:29.528 --> 25:31.196
lost my mind for a minute there.

25:31.279 --> 25:33.532
[Jungoo] I, uh…
[sobbing]

25:33.615 --> 25:34.658
Please don't do this.

25:35.408 --> 25:36.535
My daughter…

25:36.618 --> 25:38.203
She just started school.

25:38.286 --> 25:39.704
[Jungoo panting]

25:39.788 --> 25:42.165
So then I'll make sure
that the funeral runs smoothly.

25:42.916 --> 25:44.000
Mr. Choi.

25:45.544 --> 25:46.795
Mr. Choi.

25:47.420 --> 25:49.339
Mr. Choi.
[groans]

25:51.967 --> 25:53.885
[Jungoo grunting]

25:53.969 --> 25:55.220
No. Mr. Choi!

25:55.303 --> 25:57.097
- What are you… What…
- [gas hissing]

25:57.180 --> 25:58.306
[screams]

25:58.390 --> 26:01.601
Mr. Choi! You fucking… Aah!

26:01.685 --> 26:04.604
- [muffled grunting]
- [horn honking]

26:05.313 --> 26:06.481
[Jungoo panting]

26:09.985 --> 26:11.861
[Jungoo coughing]

26:11.945 --> 26:14.072
[muffled grunting]

26:18.451 --> 26:22.122
[horn honking]

26:32.716 --> 26:33.550
[engine stops]

26:34.217 --> 26:35.176
[seat belt clicks]

26:53.903 --> 26:54.904
[car lock beeps]

26:56.698 --> 26:59.618
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

27:07.167 --> 27:08.585
[police] Did you get them checked?

27:16.343 --> 27:17.719
[Cha Giho] Corporal Oh Hyejin?

27:19.929 --> 27:22.140
[chews gum]

27:25.602 --> 27:27.145
Yes, I'm Oh Hyejin, sir.

27:32.651 --> 27:33.985
You know who I am?

27:37.822 --> 27:38.823
I do, sir.

27:40.116 --> 27:41.993
Captain Cha Giho of the Narcotics Bureau.

27:45.330 --> 27:46.414
[door lock beeps]

27:50.502 --> 27:52.921
OFFICER: OPEN RECRUIT
CORPORAL: SPECIAL PROMOTION

27:53.004 --> 27:56.508
FATHER: OH JINYEONG
MOTHER: BAE SUYEON

27:57.092 --> 27:58.385
[Cha Giho] Why did you do it?

27:58.968 --> 27:59.969
[Jiwoo] What?

28:00.845 --> 28:02.847
Your evidence was somewhat inconclusive.

28:04.557 --> 28:05.892
So the arrest was uncalled for.

28:05.975 --> 28:09.688
Well, I believe the motive was clear
and he posed a serious flight risk, sir.

28:09.771 --> 28:11.189
Yes, but that's not a valid reason.

28:11.272 --> 28:12.899
Park Changoo has three priors on record.

28:12.982 --> 28:15.443
I'm sure he would have fled
if I told him I was a cop.

28:16.236 --> 28:17.821
So I believe it was valid.

28:23.660 --> 28:24.911
[inhales deeply]

28:25.537 --> 28:27.038
You've applied to this bureau twice.

28:28.665 --> 28:30.709
- Yes.
- [Cha Giho] Why so eager?

28:30.792 --> 28:32.627
Why do you wanna join this bureau?

28:35.338 --> 28:36.965
Because there's someone I wanna find.

28:37.048 --> 28:38.049
Who's that?

28:41.928 --> 28:43.722
Is it something you can tell me about?

28:45.724 --> 28:46.975
[inhales sharply]

28:47.767 --> 28:49.227
I like punks like you.

28:49.894 --> 28:53.732
You won't survive if you're only here
for the salary or the pension.

28:55.650 --> 28:58.278
- [paper rustles]
- [object clatters]

29:04.534 --> 29:06.786
[engine revving]

29:28.933 --> 29:29.768
[engine stops]

29:32.896 --> 29:33.938
[alarm beeps]

29:40.361 --> 29:42.030
Were you waiting for a while?

29:42.614 --> 29:43.823
Hmm.

29:43.907 --> 29:44.949
[sighs]

29:45.742 --> 29:46.701
Here you go.

29:51.873 --> 29:54.000
[sniffs]
What's in here?

29:54.584 --> 29:58.087
Chamomile tea.
It's supposed to help with insomnia.

29:58.588 --> 30:00.381
I know you have trouble sleeping.

30:03.134 --> 30:04.302
[spitting]

30:07.055 --> 30:08.765
[Mujin] Why does it taste like makeup?

30:11.100 --> 30:13.186
This won't help me sleep. It's too gross.

30:13.853 --> 30:14.896
[scoffs]

30:16.397 --> 30:18.149
How do you like being a cop?

30:19.275 --> 30:20.860
[sighs]

30:23.112 --> 30:25.031
I've been moved to the Narcotics Bureau.

30:28.326 --> 30:29.786
Now, it's starting for real.

30:33.873 --> 30:35.917
If I can find out who the gun belonged to…

30:38.044 --> 30:41.047
and what exactly Cha Giho
had to do with my dad's murder.

30:42.215 --> 30:43.341
Then I…

30:44.342 --> 30:45.844
I'll have more answers.

30:48.513 --> 30:49.889
Then I'll know who killed him.

30:51.266 --> 30:54.602
[ship horn honking]

30:55.186 --> 30:56.521
[Donghoon whistles]

30:56.604 --> 31:00.149
[Jiwoo] My dad and I used to talk about
building a beach house and live there.

31:01.985 --> 31:05.697
We'd hang a hammock out front
and we'd fish and swim every day

31:05.780 --> 31:07.532
like people with nothing to do.

31:10.660 --> 31:12.412
'Cause he wanted to live like that.

31:17.667 --> 31:19.669
[somber music]

31:20.587 --> 31:23.298
And I always wonder
if he were still alive now…

31:27.176 --> 31:29.178
would we be able to live like that?

31:37.729 --> 31:39.063
[Mujin] Do you see that warehouse?

31:40.189 --> 31:42.025
Just about ten years ago,

31:42.108 --> 31:43.818
Donghoon saved my life over there.

31:45.737 --> 31:48.990
Everybody was attacking,
trying to take down the organization.

31:49.073 --> 31:50.116
[car horn honks]

31:50.199 --> 31:51.576
- [crashes]
- [gangster groans]

31:52.660 --> 31:55.663
[men grunting]

31:56.915 --> 31:58.791
[groaning]

32:02.378 --> 32:03.588
[Donghoon] Mujin!

32:03.671 --> 32:05.298
[groaning]

32:06.841 --> 32:09.552
[men grunting]

32:10.511 --> 32:11.429
[groans]

32:17.936 --> 32:18.978
[Donghoon] Hey.

32:19.062 --> 32:20.021
You psycho.

32:20.104 --> 32:24.275
[laughing]

32:24.359 --> 32:25.652
Ah, shit.

32:25.735 --> 32:26.861
Hey.

32:26.945 --> 32:29.447
How can I possibly abandon you here?

32:29.530 --> 32:30.782
[groans]
Come on.

32:30.865 --> 32:32.659
- It hurts, though. It hurts.
- Get up!

32:32.742 --> 32:35.411
- [grunting]
- [groaning]

32:35.495 --> 32:38.539
[laughter]

32:40.416 --> 32:42.043
[Taeju] Okay, guys.

32:42.126 --> 32:43.503
Smile for the camera.

32:44.253 --> 32:45.421
- [chuckles]
- Will you be okay?

32:45.505 --> 32:47.131
Too old for this.

32:47.215 --> 32:48.216
[camera shutter clicks]

32:51.928 --> 32:53.304
[Mujin] I'm giving you my dagger.

32:59.185 --> 33:00.853
You kill him as soon as you can.

33:02.939 --> 33:04.065
Trust me.

33:05.608 --> 33:08.319
No matter what happens,
the organization will protect you.

33:28.923 --> 33:30.425
[drawer scrapes]

33:39.934 --> 33:40.977
Later, okay?

33:45.940 --> 33:48.067
[Changoo] God, these questions
are fucking pointless.

33:48.151 --> 33:50.737
Hey, motherfucker!
You haven't answered me! Hey!

33:50.820 --> 33:52.321
- Hey! Why are you cursing the man?
- Did you hear? You…

33:52.405 --> 33:54.240
- You're not getting anything that way.
- Did you hear what he just called me?

33:54.323 --> 33:56.200
And he's all shaken up now.

33:56.284 --> 33:57.201
[Daesoo] God.

33:57.285 --> 33:58.619
Changoo. Hey.

33:58.703 --> 34:00.204
Who cares about loyalty anymore?

34:00.288 --> 34:02.081
Money is the real boss, right?

34:02.874 --> 34:03.750
Here.

34:05.168 --> 34:08.212
The name's of five big dealers
and your boss, right it down, huh?

34:08.296 --> 34:09.172
[scoffs]

34:10.173 --> 34:11.591
Isn't your dad turning 60?

34:11.674 --> 34:13.051
Don't wanna miss the party.

34:13.551 --> 34:15.428
- Write it down.
- [Changoo] But I don't…

34:15.511 --> 34:16.637
Jesus, just forget it.

34:16.721 --> 34:18.514
There's plenty of other assholes
who will talk.

34:18.598 --> 34:21.142
- So get up, you little piece of shit.
- Wait! Hold on! Just hold on!

34:21.934 --> 34:22.894
No.

34:25.813 --> 34:27.648
I really can't just give up our boss.

34:27.732 --> 34:29.067
- [Daesoo] You little shit.
- [sighs]

34:29.150 --> 34:30.902
It's like you're playing hard to get.

34:33.362 --> 34:35.573
You wanna ask me out, huh?

34:41.162 --> 34:42.789
I can't give you names.

34:44.832 --> 34:46.417
I can give you something else, though.

34:47.293 --> 34:48.252
What?

34:49.879 --> 34:51.005
Are you crazy?

34:51.589 --> 34:53.091
There's this candy that's really hot.

35:01.766 --> 35:03.726
[keyboard clacking]

35:05.937 --> 35:06.979
[Changoo sniffs]

35:09.941 --> 35:11.442
Do you know who sell this stuff?

35:15.655 --> 35:17.115
CALL US ANYTIME IF YOU HAVE QUESTIONS

35:17.198 --> 35:18.491
[Daesoo] You fucking asshole.
How dare you--

35:18.574 --> 35:19.742
Wait, wait, wait.

35:22.995 --> 35:23.955
Who is it?

35:25.957 --> 35:28.626
Mango.
[chuckles]

35:30.795 --> 35:31.879
I'll be right back.

35:32.672 --> 35:33.923
INTERROGATION ROOM

35:34.006 --> 35:35.007
Hey.

35:36.008 --> 35:37.510
Mango is still your contact?

35:40.012 --> 35:40.972
Huh.

35:41.931 --> 35:44.183
Yeah, find out where Mango is.
Hold on. Don't hang up.

35:45.601 --> 35:48.729
NARCOTICS TEAM 1

35:48.813 --> 35:49.981
Why are you here?

35:51.357 --> 35:52.275
[door lock beeps]

35:52.358 --> 35:54.402
You don't let strangers in.

35:56.821 --> 35:59.699
- Park Changoo is still in questioning.
- Yeah, I know that, sir.

36:00.449 --> 36:03.035
- Then why are you here?
- I was just transferred to this bureau.

36:03.119 --> 36:04.662
[Changoo] Asshole.

36:04.745 --> 36:06.205
You fucking narc? Shit.

36:06.289 --> 36:07.748
- Shut up. Stop that.
- [groans]

36:08.249 --> 36:09.584
Ah!

36:09.667 --> 36:11.252
- Who's this?
- [door lock beeps]

36:11.335 --> 36:12.795
[Cha Giho] Uh, when did you get here?

36:13.337 --> 36:15.423
- Come in. Let's go. Let's go.
- Captain.

36:15.506 --> 36:16.465
But…

36:17.175 --> 36:18.801
- Here. Right this way.
- I'll call you back.

36:18.885 --> 36:19.927
[Jiwoo] Yes, sir.

36:20.970 --> 36:21.929
[Pildo] What…

36:22.847 --> 36:24.098
[Pildo sighs]

36:24.182 --> 36:26.267
Captain. Captain.

36:27.685 --> 36:29.270
So, you just joined our team?

36:29.353 --> 36:30.354
- [door closes]
- [Pildo] What's going on?

36:30.438 --> 36:31.314
Your partner.

36:31.397 --> 36:33.399
Seriously, sir, I can't work with her.

36:33.482 --> 36:35.151
Junho's leg hasn't even healed yet.

36:35.735 --> 36:37.278
Well, that wasn't her fault.

36:37.361 --> 36:39.197
You just clashed while on the same case.

36:39.280 --> 36:41.574
Exactly. Don't you think
that's a bad sign, though?

36:41.657 --> 36:42.909
You want her for my partner…

36:43.701 --> 36:45.620
Do you want me to carry her on my back?

36:46.329 --> 36:48.623
She seems tenacious and very useful.

36:48.706 --> 36:50.249
She wants to catch someone.

36:51.417 --> 36:54.003
[sighs]
Well, who doesn't?

36:55.087 --> 36:57.465
You keep an eye on her
and see if she'll last here.

36:57.548 --> 36:59.550
Well, I don't think
she'll even last a month, sir.

36:59.634 --> 37:01.093
[Cha Giho] You look into the candy?

37:03.095 --> 37:04.263
Yeah.

37:04.347 --> 37:05.848
Park Changoo talked to us.

37:05.932 --> 37:07.099
Mango is the one.

37:07.183 --> 37:08.559
So, bring him in.

37:08.643 --> 37:09.644
[Pildo] Okay.

37:10.561 --> 37:12.813
We don't have time. The boat's here.

37:18.486 --> 37:20.696
[computer beeping]

37:21.364 --> 37:22.907
It's not letting me log on.

37:22.990 --> 37:24.825
Our system is a different one.

37:24.909 --> 37:26.118
I think you need to register.

37:26.202 --> 37:27.787
Why do you wanna log on?

37:28.955 --> 37:31.082
So I can check the status
of the investigation.

37:31.624 --> 37:32.583
[Pildo] Ah…

37:32.667 --> 37:34.460
Status of the investigation.

37:34.543 --> 37:37.964
Status of the investigation is that
a moron wasted six months of work.

37:40.007 --> 37:41.467
I'm truly sorry about that.

37:41.550 --> 37:43.844
I can register you on our system now.

37:43.928 --> 37:46.222
Why even bother? Not like she lasts long.

37:47.556 --> 37:48.724
[sighs]

37:49.558 --> 37:51.060
Well, what would you like me to do now?

37:54.313 --> 37:55.481
I don't know.

37:56.899 --> 37:58.234
No idea what to do with you.

38:01.112 --> 38:02.571
[cell phone vibrates]

38:06.075 --> 38:07.285
Huh.

38:08.202 --> 38:09.328
[Pildo] He's there?

38:09.996 --> 38:11.038
Got it.

38:12.623 --> 38:13.624
Let's go.

38:14.333 --> 38:16.252
- What?
- [Pildo] Time to get to work.

38:17.086 --> 38:18.754
- Mango.
- Okay.

38:18.838 --> 38:19.964
[door lock beeps]

38:26.429 --> 38:30.933
DEAD BODY OF BAE JUNGOO
CRIME SCENE PHOTOS

38:31.017 --> 38:32.685
SUICIDE NOTE FOUND WITH BODY

38:32.768 --> 38:35.062
MY DEAR WIFE AND DAUGHTER
I'M SORRY FOR LEAVING YOU

38:38.733 --> 38:39.692
[phone beeps]

38:43.696 --> 38:44.864
[Cha Giho] Cha Giho here.

38:45.990 --> 38:48.868
I think it's Choi Mujin,
he's gonna make his move soon.

39:01.672 --> 39:04.425
Yamamoto has expressed interest
in striking a deal with us, sir.

39:06.677 --> 39:08.137
How big of a deal?

39:08.220 --> 39:10.514
The first transaction would be 50 billion.

39:13.726 --> 39:14.894
Should I refuse?

39:15.644 --> 39:18.606
It will become a problem
if we can't meet demand.

39:20.483 --> 39:21.984
They just found Mr. Bae.

39:22.651 --> 39:23.611
Hmm.

39:24.570 --> 39:26.822
I'll make a point of going there
next week.

39:30.326 --> 39:32.411
I don't think I've seen
that tumbler before.

39:33.454 --> 39:35.831
- Chamomile tea.
- [Ms. Kang] Uh…

39:36.415 --> 39:37.958
Chamomile tea?

39:39.126 --> 39:40.628
Nice work, Ms. Kang.

39:53.015 --> 39:54.767
Jiwoo just joined the Narcotics Bureau.

39:56.268 --> 39:57.853
This will be very useful.

39:59.230 --> 40:00.898
And you really think you can trust her?

40:03.275 --> 40:04.902
I, myself, don't think
we should trust her.

40:06.362 --> 40:08.489
I trust the power of her desperation.

40:10.616 --> 40:12.535
Jiwoo will serve as our dagger.

40:12.618 --> 40:14.954
If things go south,
we'll have to kill her.

40:19.708 --> 40:20.835
That's correct.

40:30.678 --> 40:32.513
[tires screech]

40:32.596 --> 40:33.681
[cat meows]

40:40.604 --> 40:43.065
[gambler 1] Goddamn it.
I just can't believe this.

40:43.858 --> 40:45.860
[gambler 2] God, that was at the worst.

40:49.780 --> 40:52.491
So, the owner of this place
goes by "Mango", okay?

40:52.575 --> 40:53.868
Head in and bring him out.

40:56.829 --> 40:58.247
And what's he charged with?

40:58.330 --> 41:00.082
Huh. No need for Miranda rights
or anything.

41:00.166 --> 41:01.459
Just go in and bring him out.

41:03.335 --> 41:04.378
Go.

41:07.131 --> 41:08.841
- [sighs]
- [door slams]

41:09.592 --> 41:10.718
Jesus.

41:23.314 --> 41:24.732
Uh, who are you?

41:26.484 --> 41:28.110
I'm here to meet with the owner.

41:29.111 --> 41:30.613
[Mango's subordinate 1] Uh…

41:30.696 --> 41:32.531
Are you like his new girl or something?

41:34.283 --> 41:36.243
Sorry, that's not my thing. Look.

41:37.870 --> 41:38.954
Mango? Where is he?

41:39.038 --> 41:40.206
Not here. Out.

41:40.789 --> 41:41.874
You have to learn to keep your hands

41:41.957 --> 41:42.875
- to yourself.
- Get out--

41:42.958 --> 41:44.627
[groaning]

41:45.377 --> 41:47.087
[grunting]

41:47.671 --> 41:49.423
[Jiwoo groaning]

41:49.507 --> 41:53.010
Hey. Get out.
[screams]

41:58.140 --> 42:00.059
[Daesoo] Pildo. Did the rookie go inside?

42:00.142 --> 42:02.436
Yeah. Mango is gonna run out
holding the drugs.

42:02.520 --> 42:03.854
Get ready to go.

42:03.938 --> 42:05.940
- [loud thudding]
- [grunting]

42:07.733 --> 42:09.777
[both grunting]

42:11.278 --> 42:12.279
[groans]

42:13.906 --> 42:15.032
[grunts]

42:17.660 --> 42:18.786
[groans]

42:21.163 --> 42:22.998
[pants]

42:24.917 --> 42:26.210
[Mango's subordinate 2] Who's that?

42:26.293 --> 42:28.462
What the hell
is happening here? What is this?

42:28.546 --> 42:30.631
- [door closes]
- [rapid footsteps]

42:30.714 --> 42:33.259
[all grunting]

42:39.515 --> 42:40.599
[groans]

42:44.728 --> 42:46.897
[Mango's subordinates groaning]

42:48.232 --> 42:50.484
[Daesoo] Fuck. What's taking her so long?

42:50.568 --> 42:51.944
How long has it been?

42:53.862 --> 42:54.822
Time to go.

42:56.949 --> 42:59.535
[gamblers chattering]

43:04.164 --> 43:06.750
[gamblers continues chattering]

43:16.427 --> 43:18.929
[Mango's subordinates groaning]

43:19.013 --> 43:21.432
[upbeat music playing]

43:24.184 --> 43:25.269
[Daesoo] What the…

43:25.352 --> 43:26.228
What…

43:26.312 --> 43:28.689
What the hell did she do? Is he dead?

43:28.772 --> 43:31.150
Pildo. Hey. Pildo. Wait.

43:32.860 --> 43:35.321
[gamblers chattering]

43:45.247 --> 43:46.165
[Mango groans]

43:46.248 --> 43:47.666
[Mango whimpers]

